# Python test artifacts. These were committed by accident in the PR that added
# the test suite; every local pytest run regenerates them with different bytes,
# so a tracked copy makes the working tree dirty after any test run and buries
# real changes in noise. A stale .pyc also served MUTATED bytecode during a
# mutation test here, briefly making a restored source look broken.
.coverage
__pycache__/
*.pyc
